<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-NETHERLANDS BEAT CZECH REPUBLIC IN FED CUP SEMIFINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NETHERLANDS BEAT CZECH REPUBLIC IN FED CUP SEMIFINAL.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Netherlands beat the Czech republic 3-2 in their Fed Cup semifinal match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Miriam Oremans/Manon Bollegraf (Netherlands) beat Jana NovotnaEva Martincova (Czech Republic) 6-4 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Singles:</p>
<p>Novotna beat Brenda Schultz-McCarthy 7-6 (7-3) 6-3  Oremans beat Adriana Gresi 1-6 6-2 9-7</p>
</text>
